      "description": "Edge-to-edge band, 2px jade top, jade label flush left.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-tk\"><b>Alerts <small>demo</small></b><span><i>Cheered</i> <em>TheNoremac</em> · 184 bits</span><span><i class=\"g\">New best</i> <em>The Lost Explorers</em> · 43.89%</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-tk{display:flex;align-items:stretch;height:52px;background:#0a0b0d;border-top:2px solid #3fd9a4;font-family:Outfit,sans-serif;overflow:hidden}.ds-tk>b{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:0 20px;background:#3fd9a4;color:#0a0b0d;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}.ds-tk small{font-size:10px;padding:3px 6px;background:#0a0b0d;color:#3fd9a4}.ds-tk>span{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:0 26px;color:#c9d0d8;font-size:15px;white-space:nowrap}.ds-tk i{font-style:normal;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#3fd9a4}.ds-tk i.g{color:#d8b263}.ds-tk em{font-style:normal;font-weight:700;color:#eef1f5}"
